  <item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.18</title><description>Fixes a case where pressing Stop could show “Input changed” and interrupt dictation paste in Apple Terminal and Herdr. A later key press or mouse click still blocks paste into an uncertain target.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:15:37 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>18</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.18</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.18/usefulwaves-0.0.18.dmg" length="5884763" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="W49t5yfHwAplgjn8LeUE0XZW8Cm+ZAV/yifi9RNHLviVsd5/9h/8+Gp2sL7p6jUAJFfygMr8D+2Sujps1fLNCg=="></enclosure><sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements></item><item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.19</title><description>QA reviews group narration, screenshots, and selected text by finding. Browse compact screenshot previews, open original evidence, and correct passages in the shared transcript reader. Your configured AI can summarize QA narration. Local previews work with AI off. The QA panel stays on screen when adding screenshots or switching findings. Cancel an active or paused meeting or QA review and recover its saved audio and evidence from Trash.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:39:32 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.19</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.19/usefulwaves-0.0.19.dmg" length="5919895" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="/newNe3e2vbTK/NHIq+rEW6pmZ0mkAXpdATKIR0aQvpM27DmHjtzXJWF5N5xzHB/RW2WRwcuaGCCL0R0pe07Bw=="></enclosure><sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements></item></channel>
